# Secrets. The repository root already ignores these (**/*.env, **/.env.*), but
# this core keeps a real subscription key in .env, so the rule is repeated here
# in case the root rule is ever loosened.
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example

# Raw captures written by cmd/doffin-probe. They are public notices, but their
# redistribution licence has not been confirmed: promote individual files into
# testdata/ deliberately, never by accident.
**/testdata/captured/

/bin/
*.test
coverage.out
